                        "glosses": [
                            "Divided into a countervair pattern of two or more tinctures."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable",
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d38008d-b82d-4c9e-93c9-c89b63a0e803",
                                "sense_id": "fc00b1e1-8c9f-3c27-8903-1076c7d0de06",
                                "text": "Bufkin. Arms.—Or, a chevron between three close helmets azure. [...] A shield [blank] impaling: Quarterly: 1, Per fess azure [and argent], a pale countercharged between three bucks' heads, two and one, erased [or]; [...] 3, Ermine, a fess counter vairy or and gules; [...] Another shield [blank] impaling: [...] 6, Counter vairy argent and azure, a canton gules."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "213893c8-3e8b-4cf2-b19d-d40eb7165e89",
                                "sense_id": "fc00b1e1-8c9f-3c27-8903-1076c7d0de06",
                                "text": "In the border of a miniature, the arms of the first owner, apparently a member of the Van Varssenaere family of Bruges (1, sable three daggers proper in bend; 2, sable three sheaves of wheat or; 3, argent vairy countervairy gules; 4, azure six ears of wheat or, 3, 2, 1)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b16c25e-8ce9-47dc-a507-73cf2094d822",
                                "sense_id": "fc00b1e1-8c9f-3c27-8903-1076c7d0de06",
                                "text": "[…] and finally that of Vaché: “Vairy and countervairy in three tiers of gold and purple, with a silver chief charged by two facing sable sphinxes, placed over the partition.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
